%%textfont Times-Bold 20
%%center Overview 
%%textfont Times-Roman 14
%%begintext align
This set lists some of the tunes for dances described in
"Captain Cook's Country Dances" by Dr. Heather Blasdale-Clarke 
[https://www.historicaldance.au/captain-cooks-country-dances-book-and-cd].

These were included in the NFF 2020 Book.


%%endtext

